==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage has an abundance of [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies. As such, [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] cats are just some of the best units you can use in this stage. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and/or [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] can all be extremely useful for taking out the Shy Boys, which are the main threat of this stage. If your [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] are weak, bring 3-4 of them to account for lack of levels. Otherwise, you may not be able to defeat the Shy Boys. The Sir Seals are not really a threat due to them spawning only after 80 seconds, and the B.B.Bunnies are just peons. However, St. Pigge the 2nds are the secondary threat and can be quite powerful, so try to account for them as well.

